&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Hardware Test Engineer to support product safety and EMC testing. You will help prepare and maintain the test environment, carry out tests, investigate issues, and document results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct product safety and electromagnetic compatibility (EMC) tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up test environments and perform tests in accordance with applicable requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and analyze test issues, and prepare and review test reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and maintain test case outlines and guidance on the inspection and safe use of commonly used instruments and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret product and industry testing standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the laboratory and carry out other tasks assigned by the Test Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or above in Electronics, Electrical Engineering, Communications, Electrical Automation, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one year of experience in EMC testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem analysis skills and the ability to summarize findings and write clear reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills, resilience under pressure, a strong sense of responsibility, self-motivation, and a willingness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with common office software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A foundation in power electronics, analog circuits, and digital circuits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read circuit schematics and PCB layout drawings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with EMC testing equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chinese and English are the working languages; good working proficiency in both is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;Translat

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lunar Sales:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Lunar Sales is a fast-track, 2-year development programme designed for ambitious professionals who want to accelerate their career at the intersection of AI, enterprise technology, and strategic sales.&amp;nbsp; If you have experience solving complex problems in a client-facing role, in management or strategy consulting or a leading industry strategy function and you are ready to bring that expertise into enterprise sales, this is your launchpad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Program immerses you in every stage of the customer sales journey, supported by motivating leaders who will help accelerate your growth beyond expectations. If you&#39;re an innovative thinker who thrives on overcoming challenges, our Top Talent Sales Program will provide strategic significance, arming you with the knowledge and tools to address complex problems, create meaningful change and excel as an Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
