&lt;p&gt;You are accountable for the &lt;strong&gt;growth and performance of strategic brand portfolios&lt;/strong&gt; across one of Paris’ most critical zones. You will act as the &lt;strong&gt;senior commercial owner&lt;/strong&gt; for your territory, ensuring alignment between Paris-wid

&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is looking for an accomplished sales professional to join our Sales Team. AI is moving from experimentation into production, and this role is an opportunity to break into AI while doing meaningful enterprise selling.&lt;/p&gt;
